Z||000018||The Fieromaster||11-07-2001||11:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B> I used to think he sang "Annie are you walkin'?"<P>I'm a huge MJ fan, not for what he is, but because his music truly is brilliant. Not necessarily good as in "I could listen to it all day long", but brilliant none the less.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Wow Annie has nothing going for her does she?  I mean she is walking according to Cliff so that means she doesnt have a Fiero (strike 1) and then Leadfoot points out that she is an orphan (strike 2) and then you got her bein a orphaned little girl and Michael Jackson singin about her (uhhh-oooh stike 3  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">) Of coarse she aint ok!! HAHA!!<P>Sorry i couldnt resist!<BR>Fierofanaticus2 = that comment was awesome it had me in tears!<BR><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">         <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">      <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">                 <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
